# End-to-End AIOps Alert Pipeline — Complete README.md

instructions** to build the full **AIOps Alert Pipeline** using:

* **Node Exporter** (metrics)
* **Prometheus** (scraping + alert rules)
* **Alertmanager** (alert delivery)
* **Flask AI Webhook** (processing alerts)
* **Slack Webhook** (notification)
* **GCP VMs** (target + monitoring)

This guide includes:
✔ VM creation
✔ Public + private IP usage
✔ Inbound/outbound rules
✔ Docker containers
✔ Full configuration files
✔ Slack setup steps
✔ Log verification steps

