#  PHASE 11 — Run Flask in Background

Install dependencies:

```bash
python3 -m venv ~/flaskenv
~/flaskenv/bin/pip install flask requests
```

Start Flask:

```bash
sudo fuser -k 5000/tcp || true
nohup ~/flaskenv/bin/python3 ai_anomaly_insights.py > ai_alerts.log 2>&1 &
```

Check logs:

```bash
tail -f ~/monitoring/ai_alerts.log
```

You should see:

```
Running on http://10.148.0.5:5000
```

